{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21286","headline":"宪宗章武孝皇帝挽歌词三首 三 · 元稹","name":"宪宗章武孝皇帝挽歌词三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月落禁垣西，星攒晓仗齐。\n风传宫漏苦，云拂羽仪低。\n路隘车千两，桥危马万蹄。\n共嗟封石捡，不爲报功泥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21286.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21286","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}